    "description": "Rarely does an entirely vacant handsome building come on the market in one of San Francisco's most historical and desirable neighborhoods, Cole Valley! This building offers varied opportunities. Co-Live with friends or family, buy as an investment, or live in one & rent out the other.  The top unit features three bedrooms and one bathroom. The lower unit includes 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom. Both units boast inviting wood floors, fireplaces in the living and dining rooms, walk-in-closets and tons of light. Classic bay windows, tall ceilings, and original built-ins in each unit's dining rooms add to the home's period charm. Residents also enjoy a shared, tastefully landscaped backyard, large attic space that has potential for development, multi-car parking garage both, plenty of storage, and washer/dryer in each unit. Near Cole street's trendy shops and delicious eateries including Bambino's Ristorante, Zazie, Kezar Bar, Beit Rima, The Ice Cream Bar, and the Reverie Coffee Cafe! Easy access to UCSF, Muni N-train, world-class Golden Gate Park and other open spaces."
  },
